# Secrets / local env (commit .env.example only)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo

# Rust / wasm build artifacts (mls-wasm / dr-wasm / relay-rs). The generated
# src/mls-pkg/ and src/dr-pkg/ ARE committed so the app/tests run without a Rust
# toolchain; rebuild with `npm run mls:build` / `npm run dr:build`.
mls-wasm/target
mls-wasm/Cargo.lock
dr-wasm/target
dr-wasm/target-native
relay-rs/target
**/target/
# EN: lockfile is committed for reproducible CI/native tests (unlike mls-wasm).
# CN: 提交 lockfile 以保证 CI/原生测试可复现（与 mls-wasm 策略不同）。

